<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\haa1長い.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"Haah... haah..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">However hard I tried to hold it down, this breathlessness would not settle.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Was it fatigue from the running, or was it from nerves?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I knew the answer myself.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The cause of this breathlessness was both.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Somehow I had to get this breathlessness under control.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The more I thought so, the more I panicked, and the harder my breathing got.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If this breathing gave away where I was, what would happen to me―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">You wouldn't have to be a genius girl to figure that out.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地入口.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The cave I had reached after running in a blind frenzy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Back then I hadn't even had room to think about where would be safe. I had dashed into this cave because it was the one that caught my eye.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But now it occurs to me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In a place this easy to find, I'm finished the moment someone comes inside.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Then why not just go outside, someone might think.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Nobody knows who is where.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I move carelessly, I'll stand out more than this ragged breathing does.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That's why I have no choice but to stay hidden here.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Why am I here?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">This is what happened about 20 minutes ago.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\ホラーサウンド.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and then </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and I had been exchanging views on the curse-killings.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\死神整列2.gal" "NORMAL" "32" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Just then, a dying </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> appeared, and on top of that, a large group wearing Noh masks.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Without giving anyone a chance to object, the group fell upon </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\赤背景.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Unable even to scream, I watched the natas and maces swinging down on </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That, if anything, deserved to be called paralysis.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I understood what was happening.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But what it meant, what would happen after this―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I had given myself over to the paralysis, body and mind, so completely that I couldn't even think about that.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組みアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="3">, what are you doing! Run, now!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "32" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "500" "30"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Suddenly </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> shoved me out of the room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Being small, I slipped through between them and fell into the hallway.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Only then did I come back to my senses, and for the first time I understood the situation I was in.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田森1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I burst out of the Niimura main house and ran aimlessly through the dark forest.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I had no idea which way to go.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My legs simply kept moving, obeying the instinct that said "Run."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Partway, I was hit by exhaustion so bad I nearly passed out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But if I collapsed here, wouldn't they come after me too?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That fear drove me on again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Thinking about it now, I may have moved more on instinct than I did on the day I was born.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地内部.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">As I went back over what had happened, my breathing finally began to settle.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At the same time, the situation I was in became clear to me all over again.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and the others had been attacked and killed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I hadn't confirmed they were dead, but I couldn't imagine anyone surviving an attack like that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If they found me, then I, too―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I didn't even know where I was, or how to get out of this settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even if I spent the night here, there was no guarantee I could walk outside safely tomorrow.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I should have been terrified, and yet I couldn't even cry.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe this is a dream.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That's right, it's still April 6, and I'm still in my bed at home.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Tomorrow I go to the Arata settlement and attend </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Eiichiro Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s thirteenth-year memorial service. [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That has to be it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That... has to be it...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Fantasies like that pushed a little relief into my heart.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then, as if pushed out by that relief, tears began to spill from my eyes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8" RUBY="どうこく">Neither wailing</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> nor </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="おえつ">sobbing</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I shed a great many quiet tears.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―what had happened to her?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And everyone else―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> surely wasn't going to make it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Had that happened because we tried to look into the curse-killings?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The group that attacked us was probably the people of the settlement.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Hadn't they wanted anyone finding out about the curse-killings?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, that couldn't be it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Everyone there should want the curse-killings solved.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then why...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Come to think of it...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Thinking back, one of the residents had said something like this.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\赤背景.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"The witch who brings in the curse"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="ちばな">Chibana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s enemy"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And then they attacked </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was the culprit behind the curse-killings.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">If you ask me, that's a baseless fabrication.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But they must have had something that made them decide so.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Not that thinking about it now does any good.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">More important, I have to think of a way to get out of here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It seems my thinking has finally switched over to constructive circuits.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That's right. Shaking and whining here won't get me anywhere.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">However much I scream, the only way to break out of this situation is to rely on my own strength.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地内部.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I wiped my tears and quietly stood up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地月光.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There was a crack in the ceiling, and moonlight lit up the inside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Underfoot, a thick mat made of hemp.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In the corner, snack and juice trash lay scattered around.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Which suggested that people came and went here often.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地内部.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">That meant I had better assume someone was likely to come here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Holing up here wasn't a smart move in the first place.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There was no water or food, and I couldn't expect any rescue from outside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So should I get out of here right away?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">In the mountains, in the middle of the night, where I couldn't tell left from right.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But that was exactly why I'd be hard to find.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Escaping now is both a good call and a bad call.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But that's hindsight talking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Whether it's good or bad can only be judged in the future.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I stepped quietly outside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My thinking was this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I was going to be found at this point, the residents would come searching in here a dozen or so seconds later anyway.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So I decided I might as well leave right away, and I acted on it.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山月.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The moon, shining so beautifully it was hateful.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Thanks to it the path was easy to see, but by the same token it carried the danger of my being easy to spot.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I would have to move forward with the utmost care, hiding in the shadows as I went.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Go back the way I came as best I remembered, cut through the settlement, then take the mountain road we had driven up―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And then make it to Arata Station.</STYLE><PG>
