{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The route was rough enough as it was, and if I was found, it was over on the spot.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'll probably never go through a survival like this again for the rest of my life.</STYLE>
