{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">My heartbeat quickened.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My knees went weak and shaky.</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The breathlessness that should have settled came back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The mind of the girl they call a genius froze up so badly it was laughable.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Then I heard muffled breathing behind me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The breathing of someone with something covering their face.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It came closer and closer to my ear.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I couldn't... even scream anymore.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Calm down. I'm on </STYLE>your<STYLE ID="1"> side."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A man's voice, slow and low.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I couldn't understand what the words meant.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">They must have reached my ears, but my frozen mind couldn't even manage to understand them.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I came here to get </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> back to Motoki-cho safely."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"L... let go of me..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"My name's Kengo Shirozaki. And </STYLE>
