{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">After a short pause, still unable to let go of my suspicion, I gave a small nod.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Good. Can you walk?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
