{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Let me introduce myself properly. Kengo Shirozaki. I live here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"N-no! Stay away! Murderer!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"C-calm down! I didn't do anything!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I screamed abuse at the man at the top of my voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Now that it had come to this, there was no point in keeping quiet here anymore.</STYLE><PG>
"Liar! You were one of the people in that crowd earlier, weren't you!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Still unable to stand, I dragged myself back into the corner.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's not it! I was against it to the very end―!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You're just as guilty! Even if you were against it, if you're one of them, you're just as guilty!
{PAUSE ""}
　Give <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> back! Give <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> back to me!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The man apologized from where he was, without coming any closer.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even so, I couldn't let my guard down around Shirozaki.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With no way left to escape, all I could do was hurl abuse at Shirozaki.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"All right, then let's do this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From inside the front of his robes, Shirozaki took out something that gleamed dully.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
