{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">A knife.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Before I could get any more </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="おび">frightened</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, Shirozaki laid the knife on the floor.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1,アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Then he sat cross-legged with his back to me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's true, I'm also to blame for not being able to save </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">her</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But I want to save at least one person. That's why I came after </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With that, Shirozaki, still cross-legged, let his shoulders drop and sighed.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"If </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> can't trust me, then I'm no use anymore. Go ahead and stab me in the neck right here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That way </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> can get away from me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">When Shirozaki laid the knife on the floor, I had figured he would say something like that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But I suspected that even this was a trap.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Honestly, I had no grounds for thinking it was a trap.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was just that for him to turn on the residents and come to rescue me, this conveniently...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was too good to be true.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So even now, I couldn't trust Shirozaki.</STYLE><PG>
"What are you after...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was a mutter, but I meant it to get my intent across precisely.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From that one line, Shirozaki should be able to tell I still suspected him.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What I'm after... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Wouldn't making amends be good enough?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"People are dead, and you call this making amends?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But if I don't, </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> won't make it home alive."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I understood Shirozaki's point.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There'd be no advantage for him in trapping me here and now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If things went wrong, I might kill him.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No... What if he's baiting me into making a move to kill Shirozaki, and showing that to the residents?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Looking for grounds to kill me that way?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">That's right. They called </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> a "witch" and killed her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I attacked Shirozaki here, I would be committing a curse-killing here too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then the residents would have a reason to kill me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Yes, this cave might already be surrounded.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Even so, it's a roundabout way of doing it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I understand that perfectly well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I understand it, but my life is on the line.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So I can't just trust him that easily.</STYLE><PG>
"Then please, tell me what happened. 
{PAUSE ""}
Why was <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> attacked?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was attacked, huh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Yeah, maybe it's best if I start there."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With that, Shirozaki swiveled around to face me, still cross-legged.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
