{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―From Shirozaki I heard about the witch's power, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and the curse-killings.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">They had killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, who had danger sense.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had danger sense, and people died one after another from her curse.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But at the same time, residents suspected residents, and suspicion kept feeding on itself.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That was why they also killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, who had the same ability.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, they thought it was </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s curse, yet at the same time they also believed it was the work of people.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Hmm. As logic it falls apart, but as the psychology of people who have been in this situation for 10 years, I can understand it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In that case―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地内部.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
