{PAUSE ""}
　Only some of the Niimura main family know about <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s ability. 
{PAUSE ""}
But one of the residents knew. 
{PAUSE ""}
If danger sense is proof of being a witch, then letting the residents learn of <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s ability would be extremely dangerous. 
{PAUSE ""}
In other words―"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see. So if it's going to add up, someone in the Niimura family tipped off one of the residents, namely </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="せ">Se</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Let me ask one more thing. 
{PAUSE ""}
What conditions did <STYLE ID="12">Sakura-san</STYLE> need in order to sense danger?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Sakura-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> could see danger coming when she was somewhere dark and cramped during cherry-blossom season. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Though if she stayed there long, she'd start feeling sick."</STYLE>
