{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I don't think you three know exactly what April sickness is. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s case I only heard about </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="ことづて">secondhand</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, so I don't know if it matches </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s exactly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But one thing I can say for sure is... </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> was waiting up on that cliff to die..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"So... she was waiting for her April sickness to kick in so she'd get dizzy and fall?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"That's what I think. However ready you are to die, jumping off from there takes courage. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
