<STYLE ID="1">The one who tipped off the residents about </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s ability was </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The accounts of Shirozaki and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> contradict each other―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">in other words, the conditions for </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s danger sense don't add up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If Shirozaki's account is right, then April sickness can't possibly strike on top of a cliff.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">The reason </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> could give such contradictory testimony was that contradictory testimony wouldn't cause him any problem.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">He knew the residents would attack soon.</STYLE>
