<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, the real source of all this was </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But why had </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> stirred up the residents and made them attack </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
