{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I think this man Shirozaki, at least, can be trusted.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, maybe I should say trusting him is the better strategy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There are no contradictions in what this man says, and he has no need for the pretext to kill me that I feared earlier.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Their aim is strictly </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and her danger sense. If I'm a target at all, it's only as a witness.</STYLE><PG>
"Are you really going to help me?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I might not be much to rely on, but that's what I mean to do."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"But that means betraying all the other residents, doesn't it? Will you be all right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, if you're asking whether I'll be all right, I won't. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But from here on, Arata can't go on the way it always has. </STYLE>
