<STYLE ID="1">"Roughly speaking, I guess that's it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="15">Shirozaki-san</STYLE>, don't you feel any hatred? Don't you think <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> is a witch...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Of course not. Not everyone thinks that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But there definitely are people so </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="おび">frightened</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> of the curse that they're out for blood. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If you cross people that bloodthirsty, who knows what'll happen to you..."</STYLE><PG>
"So you're saying some joined the attack because they had to, to protect themselves."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah. In fact, before the attack earlier, someone who objected got cut down by the guy leading them. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">She survived, but still, it's hard to go against them openly."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Which means that right now, <STYLE ID="1">Shirozaki-san, your</STYLE> position is in danger too."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I pretended to join in, and hid outside the Niimura main house. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Then </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> came running out, so... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">From the look of it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">the girl from Motoki-cho</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> got killed, didn't she?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... I've done you a terrible wrong..."</STYLE><PG>
"But is this okay? If you bother with someone like me, <STYLE ID="15">Shirozaki-san</STYLE>, won't you be late getting away yourself?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Didn't I tell you earlier? It's to make amends. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I want to get as many people home safely as I can, even one more."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............
{PAUSE ""}
All right. Right now I have no choice but to rely on you, <STYLE ID="1">Shirozaki-san</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
If it's all right with you, please help me."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Got it. In that case, we'd better leave here soon. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">How's your body holding up?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Honestly, I'm pretty worn out from running earlier. Walking all the way down that mountain road would be a bit..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay, then we'll use a buggy. I've got one parked at my house."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Uh... what about the other people from Motoki-cho..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Sorry, I don't know what happened to them either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'd like to make sure everyone's safe, really, but just getting </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> away on your own is probably all I can handle..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I... see..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and the others―did I have no choice but to leave them to die?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, right now I shouldn't be the one deciding whether to save them or not.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'll leave it to Shirozaki-san's judgment and follow his plan.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If anything happens to Shirozaki-san, my survival drama ends in failure.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then first, I need you to hang in there until we get to my house."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okay. Thank you for looking after me."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Also, these red robes and the Noh mask, </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> should... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Um, what's </STYLE>your<STYLE ID="1"> name...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'm Erina Goto. Please call me Goto."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay, </STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> wear the Noh mask and the robes. Even if we're spotted, it should fool them a little."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Shiyo 800, April 8, 1 a.m.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The moon, a little past its highest point, shone down on this bleak forest.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を歩く2人.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田森1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I left the lead to Shirozaki-san and followed his back, wearing baggy red robes and an oversized Noh mask.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Shirozaki-san walked slowly, as if out for a stroll with a toddler, and kept looking back to check on me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But my legs were worn out to begin with, and on top of that I was in this outfit that was hard to walk in.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Again and again, I tripped on roots and stones.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Shirozaki-san held out his hand to me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Sorry..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I obediently reached out too, and took Shirozaki-san's thick hand.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This really was no different from a toddler out on a walk.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\すきま風の声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を歩く2人.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山月.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Where are the other residents?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't know. I came after </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> right after that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Then it's possible they've split up and are searching for survivors, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Not just possible. They're almost certainly doing that..."</STYLE><PG>
"But if so, it's awfully quiet, isn't it? 
{PAUSE ""}
Are they all spread out over that wide an area...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, they're probably not spread out that far. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="16">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> would be another story, but </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> don't know the area, so they wouldn't expect you to get very far. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Hmm... now that you mention it, that is strange. We should've sensed someone by now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
"Uh... earlier I was shown the residents' register here. 
{PAUSE ""}
I remember the name of the first person curse-killed, 'Yuriko Shirozaki.' 
{PAUSE ""}
Could that person be..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"She was my wife."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Then you must hate the culprit..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm no buddha or </STYLE><STYLE ID="17" RUBY="ぼさつ">bodhisattva</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, so if I said I felt no hatred, I'd be lying. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But if I act out of anger, it only leads to something even more horrible. Like today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"And besides, that day... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The day before Yuriko died, she'd been trying to call the police and get them to investigate the settlement."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The police...?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah. Whether that was a mistake or not, I don't know. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">All I can say is, Yuriko truly wanted peace for this settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If I went and did something crazy, I'm sure it would make Yuriko sad."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So that's how it was..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"And now it's come to this, and I don't know how I can face Yuriko... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So at least I want to send one person home safe. For </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
you<STYLE ID="1">, and for Yuriko."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">By this point, my suspicion of Shirozaki-san had almost entirely vanished.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It wasn't because his story had no contradictions or anything like that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This man simply, sincerely wanted peace for this settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A person like that would never commit murder.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Sure, given his position, he probably couldn't afford to make enemies of the radicals.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even so, Shirozaki-san had tried to do everything he could.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The outcome was a sad one, but things hadn't fallen into the worst-case scenario yet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I could make it back alive, we could reach an ending that was at least a little better, the best still possible now.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I'm an outsider, and whatever becomes of this settlement, it doesn't harm me directly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But this settlement is a place tied to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="18">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is its head.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I want to do something about this disaster too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But still, compared with someone directly involved like Shirozaki-san, I can never match how desperately he feels it.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">What I can do now is get home alive.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That's also what Shirozaki-san wants.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I stick my nose in carelessly, I'll only drag him down.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But even if I can't solve anything, I want to go home together with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and the others.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Just then, Shirozaki-san stopped walking.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田森1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"All right, we enter the settlement from here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
You<STYLE ID="1"> hide here. I'm going to go check things out."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okay..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If I'm not back in 10 minutes... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">then I'm sorry, but go straight down this road. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Keep going and going, follow the tire ruts, and you should reach Arata Station."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"By myself...?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I know you're nervous, but it's dangerous for us to go to my house together without checking first."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okay..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Don't worry, I'll make sure you get home safe."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">And with that, Shirozaki-san vanished from my sight.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I immediately sat down under a nearby tree.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I curled up tight so the moonlight wouldn't fall on me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">10 minutes... Long or short, I couldn't tell anymore.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and the others―were they all right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If they really were after only </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, there was a chance they were safe.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had died―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For me it was the most terrible thing imaginable, and yet it still didn't feel real.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That's why, strangely, I feel no sorrow.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">If I make it home alive, that sorrow will surely crush me, little by little.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Can I go on living in a world without </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> in it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I lose </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What if... I went looking for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and the others right now...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Going to look right now, rather than later, raises the chances of seeing them alive.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">After all, I could be attacked at any moment myself.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But I only thought it, and my legs stayed hugged tight in my arms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Part of it was that I was too scared to move.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I went off on my own, how much trouble would that cause Shirozaki-san?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Shirozaki-san must be risking his life just to save me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I can't wreck his resolve on an outsider's judgment.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "10000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">Then, someone running toward me, footsteps loud―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Was it Shirozaki-san?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, it couldn't be.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Running up with footsteps that loud would be like announcing to everyone else that I was here.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Enemy or ally―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I hugged my head and made myself even smaller.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Please...! Let it be someone on my side...!</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "500" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="1">, come here, quick!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A voice calling me with no attempt to keep it down.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This voice―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">It was Shirozaki-san.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I was relieved, and at the same time I realized the situation had changed again.</STYLE><PG>
"What's wrong?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Something's off. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Everyone..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Everyone...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"The residents, all of them... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
