<STYLE ID="1">have been killed."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">What does he mean?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The residents, meaning the group that attacked </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, have been killed?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And if he can say flat out that they were killed, there must be visible wounds.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田森1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Everyone's bodies are lying all over the place, in horrible shape. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So there's less chance we'll be attacked, but we'll have to go through there to get to my house..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It can't be helped. If that's the only way..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I have no idea what's going on either. Let's get out of here, fast."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を歩く2人.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Shirozaki-san took my hand again and started walking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">He wasn't running with loud footsteps like before, but he walked a little faster than in the forest.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集落1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
