{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Before long, the houses of the settlement came into view.</STYLE><PG>
"Ugh..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">On the moonlit ground, misshapen things lay here and there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It didn't take me long to realize they were people.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\裏\荒田住人死んでる.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">One whose neck was bent the wrong way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">One twisted hard around the torso.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">One lying curled up in a red puddle.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Every one of them was wearing a Noh mask and red robes, or else had them torn or knocked off.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Judging by the state of the bodies, they had been attacked not with guns but with handheld weapons.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With this many dead, it seemed the residents had split into two factions and fought each other.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Like Shirozaki-san said, there must have been some who disliked extreme action.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Still, for that, what they did in the end was extreme.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Rather than people who dislike extreme action, maybe I should call them a faction strongly opposed to attacking outsiders like </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Either way, it's no more than guesswork, but I need to get away from here fast.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\城崎家.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"This is my house. Wait here a second."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With that, Shirozaki-san went into the house and soon came back carrying something long.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It looked like a hunting rifle.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Being unarmed doesn't feel too safe, after all. Now, get on!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Following Shirozaki-san's instructions, I took one step toward the buggy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But my foot wouldn't take the second step.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> and the others..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... You're worried about them..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Is it really all right if I run away...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I understand how you feel, but right now you should think about </STYLE>your own<STYLE ID="1"> safety. Looking for survivors now is dangerous. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Something strange seems to be going on in this settlement."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギー運転中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\バギー正面.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Clinging to Shirozaki-san's back, I cut through the mountain-road air with my body.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was the mountains at this time of year, but maybe thanks to the red robes, I didn't feel very cold.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I had ended up leaving with nothing but the clothes on my back, so all I had with me was my phone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My change of clothes, my wallet, everything was still back at the Niimura main house.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even if I spent the night at Arata Station, could I get back to Motoki-cho without a cent?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In that case, maybe I should call the police right away and have them take me in...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Or would it be better to contact my family and have them come get me?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">There was nothing as gruesome as the settlement on this mountain road.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The trees swayed with the wind, and the moonlight was as calm as ever.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was as if everything that had happened earlier was a lie.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Shirozaki-san drove the buggy without a word.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I really wanted him to take me somewhere with lots of people, but considering the buggy's mileage and tank size, that was probably impossible too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Out in the country like this, there probably weren't any gas stations open at night either.</STYLE><PG>
{DELETECG "000" "14" "200" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギーアイドリング.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
"Whoa!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Suddenly the buggy braked hard and stopped.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "SE" "500" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">As soon as it stopped, the buggy's engine cut off too.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\バギー正面停止.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Over here, quick! I saw someone up ahead!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Someone!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Before I could answer, Shirozaki-san scooped me up again and ran into the trees.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">About 5 meters in from the road, he set me down and hid.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I hid behind a tree too, the same as Shirozaki-san.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\隠れる草むら3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Shirozaki-san</STYLE>, can you see in a place this dark?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, I grew up in the mountains, and there's the moon. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Looks like there are at least two people up ahead."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Two...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I couldn't tell who, though..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Anyone out here in the mountains was almost certainly one of the residents.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And two of them...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then the footsteps gradually came closer.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I hid myself even lower, and Shirozaki-san raised his hunting rifle.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Mixed in with the footsteps, I could hear their voices too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="19">"It should be right around here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="19">"We're searching around here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="19">"Yeah."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Sure enough, there seemed to be two of them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But what was it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Voices I felt I'd heard somewhere before...</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Shirozaki-san</STYLE>, please wait."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I whispered to Shirozaki-san as he aimed the gun.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Shh! Quiet!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Please don't shoot them!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Puzzled, Shirozaki-san lowered the gun.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="1">'s definitely somewhere around here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"She's with that man Shirozaki, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I knew it!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">These two are...!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I leapt out onto the mountain road.</STYLE><PG>
"Ojisan! Obasan!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\バギー正面停止.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "600" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "300" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="20">"</STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="20">!?"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="21">"</STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="21">!?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "500" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―At last, real </STYLE><STYLE ID="22" RUBY="あんどかん">relief</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> came to me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It wasn't that I still doubted Shirozaki-san, but there's a big difference between people you've known a long time and people you haven't.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">According to them, our phones had a bugging app planted in them, and when the two of them learned something was wrong in the settlement, they had come up from the storage shed next to Arata Station.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Both of them knew what had happened to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even so, they had walked this long mountain road to come and save us.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\バギー正面停止.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "600" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="21">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="21">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In particular, </STYLE><STYLE ID="21">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> wore a dark expression the whole time because of </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Her daughter</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s survival looked hopeless, so that was only natural.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And yet they had come like this anyway, and I felt nothing but gratitude.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="20">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="21">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="20">, you go back to the station with </STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="20">. I'll go to the settlement alone."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="21">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="20">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="21">!? By yourself...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="20">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> looked over at Shirozaki-san.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, it can't be helped that you don't trust me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Goto-chan<STYLE ID="1">, you'd feel safer with these two than with me too, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">However it had come about, Shirozaki-san had brought me to the two of them like this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I couldn't bring myself to doubt him now.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then let's do this. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'll lend the buggy to </STYLE><STYLE ID="21">your wife</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, so please get somewhere as safe as you can. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'll go to the settlement with </STYLE><STYLE ID="20">your husband</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="20">"Hey, can </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="20"> really be trusted...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="20">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was still giving Shirozaki-san a suspicious look, but―</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="20">Ojisan</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="1">Shirozaki-san</STYLE> is on our side. I can vouch for him."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="20">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="20">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> let out a big sigh through his nose.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="20">"All right. Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="20">, I'd like you to lead the way."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Understood."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="21">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="20">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="21">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="20">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="21">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="20">, now we've got more allies. We should split up the work."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="21">"All right... Please look after </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="21">, okay?"</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">............?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, she said...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Of course. Through the bugging app, they know </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s situation too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Which means...!</STYLE><PG>
"Could it be that <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> is safe!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="20">"Yeah. Looks like she's hiding somewhere right now."</STYLE>
